    'about.point2.h3': 'Operational trust', 'about.point2.p': 'We prioritize stability, security and continuity so technology works in your favor.',
    'about.point3.h3': 'Multidisciplinary talent', 'about.point3.p': 'We integrate development, infrastructure and support to offer a more complete response.',
    'about.sig.span': 'What sets us apart?', 'about.sig.p': 'We combine support, development and infrastructure under one vision so clients receive clear, organized and sustainable answers.',
    'about.mini1.span': 'Operational clarity', 'about.mini1.p': 'We explain every solution in plain language, with technical order and a focus on continuity.',
    'about.mini2.span': 'Integral experience', 'about.mini2.p': 'We unite infrastructure, software and support to better accompany each stage of the project.',
    'trust.kicker': 'Why choose SMED', 'trust.h2': 'A clearer, more human and reliable technology experience',
